wine ווען: ⌝'naarTekst'⌜ טו: ⎬ <- ⌝'merlot'⌜.
⎨.


wine ווען: ⌝'='⌜ טו: ⎬ :other wine <- ﴿ זיך toString = other wine ﴾.
⎨.

wine ווען: ⌝'=='⌜ טו: ⎬ :other wine <- ﴿ זיך toString = other wine ﴾.
